NT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예측할 수 있도록 구축된 메뉴이며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▷ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청 참고자료로 활용 가능합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #bfe9cd; COLOR: #b51010; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #bfe9cd; COLOR: #b51010; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업사정자료 확인중으로</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #bfe9cd; COLOR: #b51010; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #bfe9cd; COLOR: #b51010; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">졸업사정내역은 변경될 수 있음을 알려드립니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #bfe9cd; COLOR: #b51010; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-pad